## The Gold Rush of In-Feed Shoppable Video

TikTok Shop has revolutionized online retail by reducing checkout friction down to two taps directly within the video feed.

### Keys to Shoppable Success:
- Mention the yellow/orange product shopping link within the first 10 seconds.
- Highlight exclusive live discounts, bundle deals, or free shipping vouchers.
- Keep the aesthetic 100% natural, as heavily branded videos are penalized in the organic commerce algorithm.
